{"index": 19, "type": "AIMessage", "content": "Now I can see the problem clearly. Let me trace the issue:\n\n1. **orders-api** business probe returns **502** (unhealthy)\n2. **catalog** dependency responds in **909ms** (very slow)\n3. **orders-api** has `dependency_timeout_ms: 150` — it will timeout waiting for catalog\n4. **catalog** has `delay_ms: 900` — an artificial 900ms delay\n\nThe mismatch is clear: the catalog adds a 900ms delay, but the orders-api only waits 150ms before timing out, causing 502 errors.\n\nThe SLO requires latency below 600ms. The fix should be to remove the artificial delay from catalog so it responds quickly.\n\n", "tool_calls": [{"name": "config_update", "args": {"service": "catalog", "source_id": "dependency-config", "key": "delay_ms", "operation": "set", "value": "0"}, "id": "call_d675d42aad984015a0777c39", "type": "tool_call"}]}
